		<title type="html"><![CDATA[TYT MD2017 / Retevis RT-82 • New MD-2017/RT-82 Beta version 2025 03 16.]]></title>

					<category term="TYT MD2017 / Retevis RT-82" scheme="http://localhost/opengd77/viewforum.php?f=28" label="TYT MD2017 / Retevis RT-82"/>
		
		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=4967&amp;p=36224#p36224"><![CDATA[
<ul><li> Disable "Use position" in VFOs, as it's not supported.</li><li> Rework '<strong class="text-strong">g</strong>' height in 6x8 fonts.</li><li> Fix flash storage corruption on all STM32 based transceivers.</li><li> Hide volume notification on power off (on HAS_SOFT_VOLUME featured platforms).</li><li> Use double height font, if enabled, in uiPowerOff and Radio info screens.</li><li> Display a marker when a channel has ALL_SKIP or ZONE_SKIP flag set.<ul>    <li> It takes care of the current selected zone (zone/All Channels).</li>    <li> Zone is displayed: '&lt;zone name&gt; Ch<strong class="text-strong">^</strong>&lt;channel number&gt;', instead of '&lt;zone name&gt; Ch<strong class="text-strong">:</strong>&lt;channel number&gt;',</li>    <li> When Roaming is enabled: '&lt;zone name&gt; <strong class="text-strong">^</strong> &lt;distance&gt;', instead of '&lt;zone name&gt; <strong class="text-strong">|</strong> &lt;distance&gt;'.</li></ul></li><li> Last heard screen:<ul>    <li> Handle Up/Down key repeat,</li>    <li> Toggles to detailed view on SK2 Down, not Long Down.</li></ul></li><li> RD-5R bug: Fix Power and ColorCode self changing to random values (it was triggered when roaming was enabled).</li><li> Fix DMR AGC wrongly applied to Voice Prompts and Beeps.</li><li> Italian update from Fabio IZ2EIB.</li></ul>The firmwares are available at: <a href="https://drive.proton.me/urls/AXN9H37HQR#767WiEWDJOXM" class="postlink">https://drive.proton.me/urls/AXN9H37HQR#767WiEWDJOXM</a><br>The voice prompts are available at: <a href="https://drive.proton.me/urls/CT7Y3QE8CC#ivbPuzbV8ty1" class="postlink">https://drive.proton.me/urls/CT7Y3QE8CC#ivbPuzbV8ty1</a><br><br><strong class="text-strong">NOTE</strong>: You <span style="text-decoration:underline">need</span> to use a CPS version greater or equal the the 2025/01/26. See the CPS section <a href="https://www.opengd77.com/viewforum.php?f=12" class="postlink">viewforum.php?f=12</a><br><br>For translators, the on-screen texts, voice prompts CSV are located at: <a href="https://drive.proton.me/urls/AFEPKF84F4#2ltiJXlnndiy" class="postlink">https://drive.proton.me/urls/AFEPKF84F4#2ltiJXlnndiy</a><p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=56">F1RMB</a> — Sun Mar 16, 2025 6:11 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
